[32m+[m[32m## 6. Development and Verification Approach[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mEvery model and library integrated into this system was independently[m
[32m+[m[32mverified against real data before being considered complete — this included,[m
[32m+[m[32min multiple cases, discovering that an initial assumption (a model's expected[m
[32m+[m[32mbehavior, a library's version compatibility, an extraction prompt's[m
[32m+[m[32mreliability) was wrong, and correcting the underlying design rather than[m
[32m+[m[32mpatching around the symptom. Specific instances of this discipline, beyond the[m
[32m+[m[32mvitals-extraction example in Section 3.1, include:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- A dependency conflict between the originally-planned clinical NER library[m
[32m+[m[32m  and the rest of the system's dependencies was identified before it caused a[m
[32m+[m[32m  production issue, leading to a considered switch to an alternative,[m
[32m+[m[32m  actively-maintained NER model family with equivalent clinical coverage.[m
[32m+[m[32m- A data-integrity bug causing duplicate transcript records to silently[m
[32m+[m[32m  accumulate across repeated processing runs was traced to its root cause (a[m
[32m+[m[32m  database foreign-key behavior interacting with a cleanup routine that didn't[m
[32m+[m[32m  account for it) and fixed at the source, with existing corrupted data[m
[32m+[m[32m  cleaned up as part of the same fix, rather than working around the symptom.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Text-parsing logic for AI-generated clinical drafts was rebuilt after real[m
[32m+[m[32m  test output revealed a failure mode (a common word inside a sentence being[m
[32m+[m[32m  mistaken for a section heading) that a review of the code alone had not[m
[32m+[m[32m  surfaced.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis pattern — build, test against real data, find real problems, fix them at[m
[32m+[m[32mthe root — was the consistent approach across the full 17-phase development[m
[32m+[m[32mprocess, and is reflected in the project's own internal status documentation[m
[32m+[m[32mmaintained throughout development.[m
